    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 Souls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up after a car crash\u2014or at least, you think you do. The world around you feels familiar, yet something is off. Every room seems to repeat, and yet there's always a difference. A flaw. An anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each section, you're given <strong>three paths</strong>. Only one is free of distortion. Choose correctly, and you save a soul. But with every step forward, a growing unease creeps in\u2014something fundamental doesn\u2019t add up. The rooms shift, and your perception grows increasingly unreliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s really going on here?</strong><br>The game offers no clear answers\u2014not right away. Maybe never. Only at the end do the pieces begin to form a picture\u2026 or do they?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Mystery Horror:</strong> Pay close attention\u2014tiny details can mean the difference between salvation and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Three paths\u2014only one right:</strong> Spot the anomaly to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Exploration with purpose:</strong> Each correct choice rescues a lost soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right path. Save what can still be saved.<br>And ask yourself: <strong><i>What if you\u2019re never meant to see the truth?</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 Souls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up after a car crash\u2014or at least, you think you do. The world around you feels familiar, yet something is off. Every room seems to repeat, and yet there's always a difference. A flaw. An anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each section, you're given <strong>three paths</strong>. Only one is free of distortion. Choose correctly, and you save a soul. But with every step forward, a growing unease creeps in\u2014something fundamental doesn\u2019t add up. The rooms shift, and your perception grows increasingly unreliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s really going on here?</strong><br>The game offers no clear answers\u2014not right away. Maybe never. Only at the end do the pieces begin to form a picture\u2026 or do they?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Mystery Horror:</strong> Pay close attention\u2014tiny details can mean the difference between salvation and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Three paths\u2014only one right:</strong> Spot the anomaly to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Exploration with purpose:</strong> Each correct choice rescues a lost soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right path. Save what can still be saved.<br>And ask yourself: <strong><i>What if you\u2019re never meant to see the truth?</i></strong></p>",
